algorithm.detail:
Read the transcript once and list every distinct manipulation move:
\begin{tightitem}
\item impersonation of an organization or role, claimed affiliations, spoofed sender/caller ID;
\item time pressure, threats, appeals to suffering or helping;
\item name-dropping neighbours or colleagues, friendly banter;
\item plausible artifacts: order/case numbers, hold music, lookalike domains, 'we never send attachments' disclaimers.
\end{tightitem}

For each strategy name the exploited trait:
\begin{tightitem}
\item role trappings $\rightarrow$ \term{attribution/trust};
\item fear and urgency $\rightarrow$ \term{reduced cognitive ability} under stress/time pressure;
\item peer pressure and helper role $\rightarrow$ desire to be helpful, cooperative, and not deviate from social expectations;
\item rapport $\rightarrow$ \term{liking}: people agree to more from someone they like;
\item create-and-fix $\rightarrow$ \term{reactance} plus gratitude.
\end{tightitem}
